  "version": "0.9.12",
  "notes": "Replace the top three-dot Capabilities shortcut with Chat options: New chat, Rate this chat, Delete chat and app tools. Add named chat-deletion confirmation; remove chat messages, ratings, answer metadata and attachments while preserving saved memories. Guard reply/memory work, ownership and same-origin deletion, and handle attachment cleanup failures. Keep drafts on cancellation or rejected deletion, recover across devices, and ignore stale chat loads/polling. Verify phone and desktop menu behavior in Chromium plus SQLite/HTTP deletion races.",
